      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.09,
          "end": 4.86,
          "en": "Now to fix this scrolling issue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.86,
          "end": 5.84,
          "en": "with the FlatList",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.84,
          "end": 9.13,
          "en": "where the content leaves our screen boundaries",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.13,
          "end": 12.68,
          "en": "a good solution is to wrap a container around the FlatList",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.68,
          "end": 15.39,
          "en": "which we already do with this View.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.39,
          "end": 18.14,
          "en": "And to then add some styling to that container",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.14,
          "end": 21.3,
          "en": "that kind of controls how much space this FlatList",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.3,
          "end": 22.61,
          "en": "can take up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.61,
          "end": 25.27,
          "en": "Because by default, a FlatList works such",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.27,
          "end": 28.5,
          "en": "that it basically has an infinite height.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.5,
          "end": 30.78,
          "en": "Now, if we restrict that height though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.78,
          "end": 34,
          "en": "through a parent container that we add around it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34,
          "end": 36.63,
          "en": "then the FlatList will become scrollable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.63,
          "end": 38.4,
          "en": "inside of that container.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.4,
          "end": 41.38,
          "en": "But with that, we can avoid that it goes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.38,
          "end": 43.913,
          "en": "beyond the boundaries of our device.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.86,
          "end": 48.75,
          "en": "So we could then add, let's say, listContainer:",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.75,
          "end": 52.68,
          "en": "style object to the game screen, and add flex: 1,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.68,
          "end": 55.28,
          "en": "on that and add a comma here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.28,
          "end": 57.22,
          "en": "To make sure that this container",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.22,
          "end": 60.29,
          "en": "takes up as much space as possible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.29,
          "end": 64.373,
          "en": "I'll also add a little bit of padding around it of 16 here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.5,
          "end": 68.53999999999999,
          "en": "And then this listContainer style property is assigned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.53999999999999,
          "end": 72.263,
          "en": "to this View here, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 73.68,
          "end": 75.67,
          "en": "Once we do that, you will see that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 75.67,
          "end": 79.8,
          "en": "if we start a new round and we keep on guessing here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 79.8,
          "end": 83.12,
          "en": "and we hopefully don't guess the number too early.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.12,
          "end": 85.26,
          "en": "Now I can still scroll here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.26,
          "end": 88.26,
          "en": "but now I can scroll the items into View",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 88.26,
          "end": 90.61,
          "en": "and they don't go outside of my screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 90.61,
          "end": 93.89,
          "en": "which of course is better than what we had before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 93.89,
          "end": 96.28999999999999,
          "en": "So now this also works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 96.28999999999999,
          "end": 97.36,
          "en": "As a last step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 97.36,
          "end": 99.82,
          "en": "we can now count the number of rounds",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 99.82,
          "end": 103.003,
          "en": "so that we can also show it here on the Game Over screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 103.87,
          "end": 106.22999999999999,
          "en": "Now counting the number of rounds to show it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 106.22999999999999,
          "end": 107.69,
          "en": "on the game over screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 107.69,
          "end": 110.38,
          "en": "is at actually not too tricky.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 110.38,
          "end": 111.55,
          "en": "In the game screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 111.55,
          "end": 115.3,
          "en": "we are already logging all our rounds",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 115.3,
          "end": 118.09,
          "en": "and in the end the length of that list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 118.09,
          "end": 121.19,
          "en": "is basically the number of rounds it took the phone,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 121.19,
          "end": 124.25,
          "en": "the device to guess our number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 124.25,
          "end": 125.7,
          "en": "So therefore all we have to do,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 125.7,
          "end": 128.6,
          "en": "is count the number of items in guess rounds.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 128.6,
          "end": 131.1,
          "en": "Once the game is finished",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 131.1,
          "end": 133.82,
          "en": "and then report that to the app component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 133.82,
          "end": 137.32,
          "en": "because the app component in the end needs that number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 137.32,
          "end": 140.16,
          "en": "to pass it down to the Game Over screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 140.16,
          "end": 143.623,
          "en": "because there we need to pass in our rounds number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 144.64,
          "end": 147.6,
          "en": "Now for this, we already have the guess rounds state here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 147.6,
          "end": 148.79,
          "en": "in the app component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 148.79,
          "end": 152.31,
          "en": "which here is not an array, but a single number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 152.31,
          "end": 153.78,
          "en": "And we wanna update this number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 153.78,
          "end": 155.56,
          "en": "as soon as the game is over.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 155.56,
          "end": 159.76,
          "en": "For this, we got this gameOverHandler already",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 159.76,
          "end": 163.69,
          "en": "which is called by the game screen when the game is over.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 163.69,
          "end": 165.68,
          "en": "And we now just need to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 165.68,
          "end": 169.13,
          "en": "that we report the numberOfRounds here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 169.13,
          "end": 172.23,
          "en": "that we get this as a parameter value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 172.23,
          "end": 176.34,
          "en": "So that in this function we can set guessRounds equal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 176.34,
          "end": 178.79,
          "en": "to this numberOfRounds.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 178.79,
          "end": 180.36,
          "en": "And now we just need to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 180.36,
          "end": 184.28,
          "en": "that this parameter is passed into gameOverHandler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 184.28,
          "end": 188.79,
          "en": "So into the onGameOver prop from inside GameScreen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 188.79,
          "end": 193.79,
          "en": "So in GameScreen, where we do call this onGameOver function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 194.51,
          "end": 199.51,
          "en": "here, we wanna pass the guessRounds length as an argument",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 201.45,
          "end": 203.04,
          "en": "because that's the number of items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 203.04,
          "end": 204.34,
          "en": "in this guess rounds array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 204.34,
          "end": 205.9,
          "en": "And that is the number of rounds",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 205.9,
          "end": 208.67000000000002,
          "en": "it took the device to guess our number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 208.67000000000002,
          "end": 211.42000000000002,
          "en": "we're passing this into the function which we receive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 211.42000000000002,
          "end": 213.32,
          "en": "through that onGameOver prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 213.32,
          "end": 217.423,
          "en": "And that turns out to be that gameOverHandler function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 218.35,
          "end": 221.87,
          "en": "With that, if we save this and we start a new game.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 221.87,
          "end": 224.38,
          "en": "If I enter a number here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 224.38,
          "end": 228.75,
          "en": "and I then keep on guessing the game is over",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 228.75,
          "end": 230.793,
          "en": "and now see six rounds here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 231.82,
          "end": 233.34,
          "en": "So this works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 233.34,
          "end": 234.82,
          "en": "And let's actually also test this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
